---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Utility Payment Tracker" description="Track water, electricity, and gas payments across multiple units with automated summaries.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/products/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Products</a>

      <h1>Utility Payment Tracker</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Track water, electricity, and gas payments across multiple rental units. Automated summaries by unit, month, and utility type. Perfect for property managers managing shared meters or allocated charges.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What's Included</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Excel Workbook:</strong> Multi-sheet tracker with auto-calculations</li>
          <li><strong>Utility Types:</strong> Water, electricity, gas, and customizable fields</li>
          <li><strong>Payment Register:</strong> Track payments by unit and month</li>
          <li><strong>Automated Summaries:</strong> Monthly and annual totals by utility and tenant</li>
          <li><strong>Dashboard KPIs:</strong> Total utilities cost, average per unit, outstanding charges</li>
          <li><strong>Tenant Allocation:</strong> Calculate per-unit share for split meters</li>
          <li><strong>PDF Guide:</strong> Instructions for setup and usage (Manager & Agency tiers)</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp Cards:</strong> 5 marketing cards (Agency tier only)</li>
          <li><strong>Offline-first:</strong> Works in Excel or Google Sheets. No subscriptions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0;">
        <h2>Choose Your Tier</h2>
        <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap:1.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem;">

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Basic</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">For small properties with up to 10 rental units.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 49</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Up to 10 tenants</li>
              <li>Excel workbook</li>
              <li>Payment register</li>
              <li>Auto-summaries</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/i143w9r719" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Pro</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">For property managers handling unlimited tenants and properties.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 99</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Unlimited tenants</li>
              <li>Unlimited properties</li>
              <li>Full workbook suite</li>
              <li>PDF guide</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/oaj57wf56u" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

          <div style="padding:1.5rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px; border-left:4px solid #516784;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:#362622;">Agency</h3>
            <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Complete suite with all features and marketing materials.</p>
            <div style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:1.5rem 0;">GHS 179</div>
            <ul style="font-size:0.9rem; line-height:1.6; margin:1rem 0;">
              <li>Full bundle + templates</li>
              <li>Unlimited everything</li>
              <li>PDF guide + forms</li>
              <li>5 WhatsApp cards</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://selar.com/8373w348v1" target="_blank" style="display:block; text-align:center; padding:0.75rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Purchase on Selar →</a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3>Key Features</h3>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>Track multiple utility types (water, electricity, gas, waste management)</li>
          <li>Monthly and annual summaries with color-coded trends</li>
          <li>Tenant allocation for shared meters or proportional billing</li>
          <li>Dashboard showing total utilities, cost per unit, outstanding charges</li>
          <li>Payment reminder system for overdue utilities</li>
          <li>Export to PDF for tenant invoices</li>
          <li>Historical data for trend analysis and budgeting</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Act 220 Compliant:</strong> Utility tracking and allocation comply with Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 requirements for transparent tenant billing and dispute resolution.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600;">Have Questions? Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
